  "input": "When can the event-bus be deployed?\n[2025-03-31] standup/boreal/2025-03-31: The event bus remains a Boreal service. [2025-01-17] standup/boreal/2025-01-17: The notification service depends on the bus for delivery events. If the event bus is down, the webhook dispatcher is down: it relies on it for outbound events. [2025-02-21] standup/boreal/2025-02-21: The bus deploy window: on Tuesdays and Thursdays between 10:00 and 12:00 UTC.",
